<hgroup><h1>What Does the History of Research on the Repair of DNA Double-Strand Breaks Tell Us?—A Comprehensive Review of Human Radiosensitivity</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Berthel%20E"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Elise Berthel</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
