<sup>1,</sup><sup>2</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Foray%20N"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id5"><span class="name western">Nicolas Foray</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id5">
<h3><span class="name western">Nicolas Foray</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>Inserm, UA8 Unit, « Radiation: Defense, Health and Environment », Centre Léon-Bérard, 28, rue Laennec, 69008 Lyon, France ; Elise.berthel@inserm.fr (E.B.); Melanie.ferlazzo@inserm.fr (M.L.F.); clement.devic@inserm.fr (C.D.); Michel.bourguignon@irsn.fr (M.B.)</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Foray%20N"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Nicolas Foray</span></a>
</div>
